The repository is already the Rust refactor of `boppreh/mouse`; only keyboard parity and the perception/control layer are missing. I found uncommitted homing changes in the mouse files and will build around them without replacing them; the implementation will use Linux `evdev/uinput`, ordered image frames as observations, and an OpenAI-compatible GPT-Sol policy endpoint with a dry-run default so model output cannot control the desktop accidentally.
