I’m adding three bounded components rather than coupling model calls directly to device code: a Rust keyboard controller/listener with record/play parity, a frame trajectory source that only accepts image files and tracks unseen frames, and a typed policy/action protocol. The agent command will require explicit `--execute`; otherwise it prints proposed actions and transition rewards to support evaluation without injecting input.
